    verification: 'wbadmin get versions muestra la primera versión del servidor, la política programada queda verificada con Get-WBPolicy y el monitoreo de no-respaldo lo cubre como a cualquier otro server de producción.',
    evidence_to_collect: [
      'Evidencia del hueco: wbadmin get versions vacío con fecha de detección',
      'Política creada (Get-WBPolicy) y primera versión generada',
      'Registro en el inventario de backup y del alta en el monitoreo',
    ],
    escalation: 'Si el volumen de datos exige destino distinto (NAS/appliance) → L3 Backup para el diseño de la política. Si se detectan más servidores fuera de la malla → incidente de proceso: L3 Backup con la lista completa y el equipo de implementación.',
    english_customer_response_template: 'Hello, we closed a backup coverage gap detected for the recently deployed server. The machine had been in production without any backup policy, so it had no restore points at all. We registered a daily backup schedule covering all critical volumes and system state, ran the first backup immediately to create the initial restore point, and added the server to the central backup inventory with an alert if it goes twenty four hours without a new backup version. The server is now inside the protection net like every other production system. Evidence is attached to ticket {{TICKET_ID}}.',
    english_technical_explanation: 'Backup coverage gap on {{HOSTNAME}} at {{TIMESTAMP}}: the server, recently delivered to production, had an empty backup history (wbadmin get versions returned no versions) and no scheduled policy (Get-WBPolicy empty). Root cause: the deployment checklist lacks a mandatory backup registration step. Remediation: a daily schedule was enabled with wbadmin enable backup targeting the dedicated disk GUID, including all critical volumes for bare metal recovery capability, and an immediate manual backup created the first restore point. The policy was verified with Get-WBPolicy and the server was registered in the central backup inventory with a no-backup-in-24h alert. Process fix: deployment checklist updated to require backup coverage before production sign off.',
    keywords: ['backup', 'cobertura', 'coverage', 'wbadmin enable backup', 'get-wbpolicy', 'get-wbbackupset', 'hueco', 'servidor nuevo', 'inventario', 'allcritical', 'bare metal', 'rpo', 'monitoreo', 'alta'],
